OL,3,GNEWSARussell Brand to be sentenced for
OL,4,Arape and sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand will be sentenced today
OL,7,Fafter being found guilty of one count
OL,8,Fof rape and three counts of sexual
OL,9,Fassault
OL,11,FBrand, 51, was found guilty at
OL,12,FSouthwark Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,13,Fafter a trial that began in October -
OL,14,Fyou'll be able to watch the sentencing
OL,15,Fitself live on this page
OL,17,FFollowing the verdicts, judge Mr
OL,18,FJustice Bennathan told Brand to expect
OL,19,F"a significant custodial term"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
